      "message": "In the discussion on https://r.android.com/c/kernel/common/+/3671615/comments/8cf096a2_738bab13, there was a report of verity_end_io being called in hardirq context.  So it seems we cannot assume that case is unimportant.",
      "parentUuid": "ab117581_13396186",
